sequenceDiagram
  participant sender as Sender local store
  participant backend as Backend
  participant database as Relational database
  participant recipient as Recipient local store
  sender->>sender: Save pending message and action ID
  sender->>backend: WSS command
  backend->>database: Check access and commit message, receipt, changes and jobs
  database-->>backend: Committed
  backend-->>sender: Saved acknowledgement
  backend-->>recipient: WSS authorized change
  recipient->>recipient: Save message and cursor locally
  recipient->>backend: After reconnect, sync from saved cursor
  backend-->>recipient: Missing authorized changes or fresh snapshot
